WEBVTT

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:05.130
Taka!

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:08.091
I enjoyed serving under you!

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:10.593
What?

00:00:11.761 --> 00:00:13.054
What are you talking about?

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:15.306
I won't allow it.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.643
Let me talk to Taiju.

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.061
What?

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:22.814
Taka...

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.864
TOKYO REVENGERS

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:05.208
What?

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:08.962
You're going too far.

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:23.184
Only use your strength to protect people.

00:02:25.854 --> 00:02:27.438
There, there.

00:02:28.022 --> 00:02:29.649
Yeah, he's a scary guy.

00:02:33.862 --> 00:02:35.780
<i>A weird guy with two little brats.</i>

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:37.490
<i>That was Taka.</i>

00:02:38.616 --> 00:02:40.368
<i>That was when I met Takashi Mitsuya.</i>

00:02:43.955 --> 00:02:44.789
Taka.

00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:46.040
Yeah?

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:49.043
I don't think you should talk with Taiju.

00:02:49.919 --> 00:02:52.547
No matter what you say,
it won't end up doing any good.

00:02:53.548 --> 00:02:54.757
He's a piece of shit.

00:02:56.134 --> 00:02:57.552
Would you stop that?

00:02:58.094 --> 00:03:00.972
You've always tried to handle things
all on your own.

00:03:01.973 --> 00:03:03.183
By the way,

00:03:03.933 --> 00:03:05.602
why are these two tagging along?

00:03:05.685 --> 00:03:06.519
What?

00:03:06.603 --> 00:03:09.105
I'm the one who got beat up!

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:11.816
I'm keeping an eye on him
because he's a moron.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.359
Hey! Who you calling a moron?

00:03:13.443 --> 00:03:16.196
You're the moron
for concocting that crazy plan!

00:03:17.071 --> 00:03:19.073
But it turned out okay, right?

00:03:20.658 --> 00:03:22.243
All right, fine.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.251
It's nice to meet you, Taiju.

00:03:30.335 --> 00:03:35.798
So, you're that Mitsuya
who's beguiled my brother all these years.

00:03:36.799 --> 00:03:38.760
That's a hell of an accusation.

00:03:38.843 --> 00:03:41.095
I'll kill you, you bastard.

00:03:46.309 --> 00:03:49.103
So, what is it you want to talk about?

00:03:49.812 --> 00:03:51.189
Keep it short.

00:03:51.272 --> 00:03:56.069
I'll let Hakkai join BLACK DRAGON
and never get involved with him again.

00:03:56.152 --> 00:03:59.447
What?
Mitsuya, that's not what you promised!

00:04:01.282 --> 00:04:02.617
Now, that's hilarious.

00:04:03.201 --> 00:04:05.745
I thought you came here
to keep that from happening.

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:07.247
In exchange,

00:04:08.706 --> 00:04:10.250
release Yuzuha.

00:04:11.834 --> 00:04:12.752
What?

00:04:14.545 --> 00:04:17.298
Taka! Why are you asking for that?

00:04:17.966 --> 00:04:21.135
Taiju, you're forcing Yuzuha
to do something for you, aren't you?

00:04:23.179 --> 00:04:25.932
Hakkai has always protected his sister...

00:04:27.642 --> 00:04:29.519
from your abuse.

00:04:29.602 --> 00:04:30.436
What?

00:04:34.315 --> 00:04:36.818
That's a rich joke.

00:04:38.361 --> 00:04:40.863
Hakkai, sit down.

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:41.781
What?

00:04:48.288 --> 00:04:49.831
S-Sure.

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:03.052
Hakkai's not leaving Toman
because he's afraid of you.

00:05:03.136 --> 00:05:05.221
He's doing it to protect Yuzuha.

00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:09.559
Mitsuya!

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:17.775
Hey... You're pretty good.

00:05:32.206 --> 00:05:33.833
I'll say it once more.

00:05:34.792 --> 00:05:37.086
We'll let Hakkai join BLACK DRAGON,

00:05:37.712 --> 00:05:39.547
but you release Yuzuha.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:44.135
If you accept these conditions,
Toman won't fight BLACK DRAGON.

00:05:44.719 --> 00:05:45.928
And if I refuse?

00:05:46.429 --> 00:05:48.014
It's all-out war.

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:52.185
I like it.

00:05:53.811 --> 00:05:55.646
We've got a truce.

00:05:56.647 --> 00:05:59.609
Though I've never abused her,

00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:01.486
I'll keep my promise.

00:06:02.111 --> 00:06:04.697
I'll never hit Yuzuha again.

00:06:13.164 --> 00:06:17.710
In the end,
Hakkai ended up going to BLACK DRAGON.

00:06:18.252 --> 00:06:20.671
Yeah. But I did learn one thing.

00:06:21.631 --> 00:06:26.386
That Hakkai is going to kill Taiju
for Yuzuha's sake.

00:06:27.804 --> 00:06:29.472
Taka, thank you.

00:06:30.431 --> 00:06:31.474
I...

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:33.726
Hakkai.

00:06:34.685 --> 00:06:38.773
No matter how tough things get,
use your strength to protect others.

00:06:41.526 --> 00:06:42.360
Taka...

00:06:50.243 --> 00:06:53.496
Luna, quit chasing Mana around!
She'll get all worked up.

00:06:54.539 --> 00:06:56.040
Sorry for all the commotion.

00:06:56.124 --> 00:06:57.333
No, it's fine.

00:07:01.212 --> 00:07:02.088
Got any parents?

00:07:02.171 --> 00:07:03.339
Just Mom.

00:07:03.965 --> 00:07:06.008
She works until late at night,

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:07.927
so I look after these two.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:09.095
Seconds!

00:07:09.178 --> 00:07:11.389
Oh, you're eating faster, Luna.

00:07:16.269 --> 00:07:17.103
Say...

00:07:18.438 --> 00:07:20.523
Isn't it hard having to deal with this?

00:07:21.107 --> 00:07:21.941
There.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:25.695
Don't curse the life you're born into,

00:07:26.863 --> 00:07:27.697
Hakkai.

00:07:33.995 --> 00:07:35.538
I think I'm going to go
back to the future.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.331
What? How come?

00:07:37.415 --> 00:07:40.209
Hakkai joined BLACK DRAGON

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:42.044
and you haven't completed
any of your goals.

00:07:43.296 --> 00:07:46.382
Hakkai killed Taiju to protect Yuzuha.

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:50.344
In that case,
now that Mitsuya got Yuzuha released,

00:07:50.428 --> 00:07:52.805
Hakkai has no reason to kill Taiju.

00:07:53.681 --> 00:07:55.516
So, the future's probably changed.

00:07:56.184 --> 00:07:57.602
Maybe...

00:07:57.685 --> 00:07:58.519
Right?

00:07:59.103 --> 00:08:01.606
But what if nothing's changed?

00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:02.982
What?

00:08:03.065 --> 00:08:06.694
It's just your assumption that
Hakkai killed Taiju to protect Yuzuha.

00:08:07.278 --> 00:08:09.030
But that's the only reason why...

00:08:09.113 --> 00:08:12.617
And weren't you arrested in the future?

00:08:13.618 --> 00:08:16.954
How are you going to shake hands
with Naoto Tachibana if you're in jail?

00:08:17.788 --> 00:08:19.165
That's right...

00:08:19.749 --> 00:08:21.667
I may not be able to come back.

00:08:21.751 --> 00:08:24.795
It's way too risky. And what's more...

00:08:24.879 --> 00:08:25.713
What?

00:08:25.796 --> 00:08:29.717
It was Mitsuya, not you,
who set Yuzuha free.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:30.635
What?

00:08:31.677 --> 00:08:36.599
If you haven't changed anything here,
then I doubt the future has changed.

00:08:37.183 --> 00:08:39.560
Now that you mention it,
you're probably right.

00:08:39.644 --> 00:08:41.479
That's pretty smart of you, Chifuyu.

00:08:42.021 --> 00:08:43.940
You're such a dumbass, Takemitchy.

00:08:44.732 --> 00:08:46.484
Are you sure you're 26 years old inside?

00:08:47.068 --> 00:08:48.069
I'm so ashamed.

00:08:48.861 --> 00:08:50.404
-Takemitchy!
-Huh?

00:08:51.447 --> 00:08:52.865
What's the matter, Hakkai?

00:08:58.287 --> 00:08:59.872
Tell Taka thanks for me.

00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:03.292
I won't be able
to see him as much anymore.

00:09:04.835 --> 00:09:05.670
Sure.

00:09:05.753 --> 00:09:06.587
Okay.

00:09:08.464 --> 00:09:09.298
You see...

00:09:10.633 --> 00:09:12.093
My family's kind of messed up.

00:09:13.177 --> 00:09:14.303
We've got no mom.

00:09:14.387 --> 00:09:16.681
And since I was little,
Dad was almost never home.

00:09:17.723 --> 00:09:20.560
<i>So, it was always Taiju, the eldest,</i>

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:22.895
<i>who ran the family.</i>

00:09:23.896 --> 00:09:26.148
<i>He's been a "boss" since he was a kid.</i>

00:09:27.024 --> 00:09:31.571
<i>He was bigger than everyone
and just plain stronger too.</i>

00:09:32.572 --> 00:09:36.200
<i>But most of all, he was an expert
at getting people to like him.</i>

00:09:36.867 --> 00:09:39.328
<i>All his cronies really admired him.</i>

00:09:41.956 --> 00:09:43.916
He used violence with great skill.

00:09:45.543 --> 00:09:47.253
<i>He didn't give half-assed beatings.</i>

00:09:47.795 --> 00:09:48.796
<i>He'd beat the crap out of you.</i>

00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:52.216
<i>He treated us, siblings, the same way.</i>

00:09:53.551 --> 00:09:54.760
Get up, Hakkai.

00:09:57.138 --> 00:09:59.390
It's not like I want to punch you.

00:10:00.349 --> 00:10:05.146
I care more about you than anyone.
And I trust you more than anyone.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.982
So, when you don't live up
to my expectations,

00:10:08.524 --> 00:10:09.942
it hurts me.

00:10:11.736 --> 00:10:14.405
I love you, Hakkai.

00:10:16.616 --> 00:10:17.491
<i>I always thought...</i>

00:10:18.159 --> 00:10:20.328
that love was supposed to be painful.

00:10:21.996 --> 00:10:23.581
Because that's how I was raised.

00:10:24.915 --> 00:10:26.292
That's the way it always was.

00:10:28.044 --> 00:10:32.006
But Taka turned my world upside down.

00:10:33.174 --> 00:10:37.011
<i>He should have been out playing,
but he was looking after those two kids.</i>

00:10:37.678 --> 00:10:39.930
<i>It seemed like
he had such a tough home life.</i>

00:10:41.182 --> 00:10:42.141
You hungry?

00:10:42.892 --> 00:10:44.685
<i>But he was always smiling.</i>

00:10:47.438 --> 00:10:49.607
When I ate the food Taka cooked,

00:10:50.483 --> 00:10:53.819
I'm not sure why, but I cried my eyes out.

00:10:54.904 --> 00:10:56.197
You know what he told me?

00:10:57.073 --> 00:10:59.325
"Use your strength to protect others."

00:11:02.453 --> 00:11:04.121
I made a promise then...

00:11:05.122 --> 00:11:06.707
to protect my family.

00:11:08.501 --> 00:11:10.711
Then, from now on,

00:11:10.795 --> 00:11:13.798
you'll take the beatings for two.

00:11:13.881 --> 00:11:15.675
You're good with that, right?

00:11:16.217 --> 00:11:19.595
FIRST GENERATION TOKYO MANJI GANG

00:11:23.307 --> 00:11:24.725
<i>From then on,</i>

00:11:25.476 --> 00:11:27.603
<i>I got Yuzuha's beatings instead of her.</i>

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:32.441
I protected Yuzuha this whole time.

00:11:33.693 --> 00:11:35.778
<i>But then, he broke his promise.</i>

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:39.990
<i>He beat Yuzuha as he had before.</i>

00:11:40.825 --> 00:11:42.868
You broke your promise!

00:11:43.452 --> 00:11:44.954
My promise?

00:11:45.037 --> 00:11:48.749
You were shielding her
from her own family!

00:11:48.833 --> 00:11:51.210
I did it to teach her a lesson!

00:11:51.293 --> 00:11:52.169
That bastard!

00:11:52.253 --> 00:11:54.046
What a total asshole!

00:11:54.714 --> 00:11:55.589
I think you can see

00:11:56.132 --> 00:12:00.386
that the promise he made to Taka
doesn't mean shit to him.

00:12:01.011 --> 00:12:03.848
He'll never release Yuzuha.

00:12:05.599 --> 00:12:07.309
I'm so ashamed to say it.

00:12:07.393 --> 00:12:09.729
But to this day,
I tremble in the presence of Taiju.

00:12:10.312 --> 00:12:12.982
I can't do a damn thing.

00:12:13.065 --> 00:12:14.191
Hakkai...

00:12:15.025 --> 00:12:16.402
If only Taiju wasn't around...

00:12:18.487 --> 00:12:19.905
So, I made up my mind.

00:12:19.989 --> 00:12:20.823
What?

00:12:20.906 --> 00:12:23.367
That's why I quit Toman.

00:12:24.118 --> 00:12:26.871
I didn't want to ruin Toman's reputation.

00:12:28.414 --> 00:12:30.374
From now on,

00:12:31.208 --> 00:12:33.377
I'll use my strength to protect my family.

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:39.592
I'm going to... kill Taiju.

00:12:43.345 --> 00:12:45.181
I'm prepared to be arrested.

00:12:45.765 --> 00:12:47.641
So, you shouldn't associate with me.

00:12:48.225 --> 00:12:50.144
Why are you telling us that?

00:12:50.227 --> 00:12:52.480
To stiffen my determination, I guess.

00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:55.483
If I didn't, I'd probably chicken out.

00:12:56.066 --> 00:12:57.067
I'm weak like that.

00:12:59.236 --> 00:13:00.988
I didn't know you long,

00:13:01.071 --> 00:13:02.531
but it was fun, Takemitchy.

00:13:06.327 --> 00:13:07.286
Chifuyu,

00:13:08.162 --> 00:13:09.997
this really ticks me off.

00:13:11.165 --> 00:13:15.252
He's been driven to such desperation
that he's going to kill his own brother.

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.381
That Taiju Shiba is total scum!

00:13:19.965 --> 00:13:21.091
Takemitchy...

00:13:21.967 --> 00:13:23.344
I've made up my mind, Chifuyu.

00:13:24.178 --> 00:13:25.971
I'm going to crush BLACK DRAGON!

00:13:27.848 --> 00:13:29.433
You're such a moron.

00:13:30.226 --> 00:13:34.897
Shouldn't you be thinking of a way
to keep Hakkai from killing Taiju?

00:13:38.734 --> 00:13:41.487
Fine! I get it! Don't make that face!

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:42.404
Good.

00:13:42.905 --> 00:13:47.535
If we crush BLACK DRAGON,
that will definitely change the future.

00:13:47.618 --> 00:13:48.452
Right!

00:13:48.536 --> 00:13:49.578
Count me in!

00:13:50.162 --> 00:13:50.996
All right!

00:13:55.501 --> 00:13:57.503
I talked to Taiju yesterday.

00:13:58.045 --> 00:13:58.879
I know.

00:13:59.839 --> 00:14:01.966
Taiju's got connections with the rich.

00:14:02.049 --> 00:14:04.844
When they've got trouble,
he loans them BLACK DRAGON goons.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:07.805
They pay him big money in exchange.

00:14:08.931 --> 00:14:12.184
It was one of my jobs
to collect that money.

00:14:12.685 --> 00:14:16.605
But yesterday,
I was released from doing that forever.

00:14:17.731 --> 00:14:19.692
It's thanks to you, Mitsuya.

00:14:20.317 --> 00:14:21.735
Why are you acting like that?

00:14:22.486 --> 00:14:24.446
It was all Hakkai's hard work.

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:25.739
His hard work?

00:14:26.657 --> 00:14:28.534
You put him up to it!

00:14:29.493 --> 00:14:30.327
Hakkai...

00:14:32.705 --> 00:14:33.747
Why'd he do this?

00:14:34.582 --> 00:14:35.624
Don't be stupid.

00:14:36.417 --> 00:14:38.794
Hakkai is a lot stronger
than you think he is.

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:41.171
Thank you, Mitsuya.

00:14:42.214 --> 00:14:43.048
But...

00:14:44.049 --> 00:14:46.677
hopes like that are what causes suffering.

00:14:50.139 --> 00:14:53.309
Yuzuha's hiding something.

00:14:54.268 --> 00:14:58.397
Now that I think about it,
it was way too easy to make this truce.

00:15:05.529 --> 00:15:07.907
Hey, Mikey! That's the wrong way!

00:15:08.824 --> 00:15:10.868
Mikey! What about the officer's meeting?

00:15:11.452 --> 00:15:13.370
Ride with me, Mitsuya!

00:15:14.872 --> 00:15:16.332
I want to ride with you.

00:15:17.416 --> 00:15:18.459
Mikey...

00:15:21.629 --> 00:15:22.630
Sorry.

00:15:23.339 --> 00:15:24.465
Thanks, Draken.

00:15:25.841 --> 00:15:27.927
Hey! What's up, Mikey?

00:15:29.303 --> 00:15:30.554
We're down to half now.

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:32.014
What?

00:15:33.599 --> 00:15:34.725
Of the founding members.

00:15:36.769 --> 00:15:37.978
FIRST GENERATION COMMANDER

00:15:39.229 --> 00:15:42.650
I've lost sight
of where I'm headed with this.

00:15:44.193 --> 00:15:45.027
Mikey...

00:15:46.487 --> 00:15:48.489
Just forget about BLACK DRAGON.

00:15:50.407 --> 00:15:51.283
Mitsuya.

00:15:51.367 --> 00:15:52.201
What?

00:15:53.077 --> 00:15:55.454
Don't you ever leave us, okay?

00:15:57.247 --> 00:15:59.083
Okay. I promise.

00:16:01.251 --> 00:16:02.086
What?

00:16:02.753 --> 00:16:05.130
You're going to fight
with BLACK DRAGON over that?

00:16:05.214 --> 00:16:06.048
That's right.

00:16:06.131 --> 00:16:08.050
Are you freaking insane?

00:16:08.592 --> 00:16:11.679
I've said I'll kill someone
over a million times, dude!

00:16:11.762 --> 00:16:15.516
If we did it every time we said it,
we'd wipe out humanity, you moron.

00:16:17.017 --> 00:16:17.851
At any rate,

00:16:18.435 --> 00:16:23.232
we aren't crushing BLACK DRAGON
just to stop Hakkai from killing Taiju.

00:16:24.441 --> 00:16:25.567
What a drag.

00:16:25.651 --> 00:16:27.653
What do you think, Draken?

00:16:29.613 --> 00:16:30.739
Rejected!

00:16:32.157 --> 00:16:33.534
Takemitchy and Chifuyu,

00:16:34.159 --> 00:16:37.454
I'm sure you have your reasons
for wanting to do this,

00:16:38.247 --> 00:16:41.667
but do you intend to violate
the truce that Mitsuya arranged?

00:16:42.918 --> 00:16:45.295
You'd be disrespecting Mitsuya.

00:16:46.505 --> 00:16:49.758
They aren't coming tonight,
but this decision is final.

00:16:52.219 --> 00:16:56.098
Yeah, I guess we definitely
would be disrespecting Mitsuya.

00:16:57.933 --> 00:17:00.811
Things just aren't going our way,
Takemitchy.

00:17:00.894 --> 00:17:01.854
Chifuyu,

00:17:02.604 --> 00:17:05.774
this means
we'll just have to do it on our own.

00:17:05.858 --> 00:17:07.109
Let me join in.

00:17:08.777 --> 00:17:09.611
-Kisaki?
-Kisaki?

00:17:10.529 --> 00:17:11.780
Why don't we work together?

00:17:12.281 --> 00:17:13.198
What?

00:17:13.282 --> 00:17:14.950
I want to stop Hakkai too.

00:17:15.034 --> 00:17:17.661
That's a load of bullshit!

00:17:17.745 --> 00:17:20.581
There's no way in hell
we'd ever work with you!

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:22.458
Then, what's your plan?

00:17:23.333 --> 00:17:27.254
As long as there's the truce
with BLACK DRAGON that Mitsuya made,

00:17:27.337 --> 00:17:31.717
none of the other Toman officers
are going to fight with BLACK DRAGON.

00:17:32.342 --> 00:17:36.680
And BLACK DRAGON isn't so weak
that you two alone can crush them.

00:17:38.223 --> 00:17:39.933
Mikey's weak right now.

00:17:40.768 --> 00:17:45.230
Now that BLACK DRAGON's gotten stronger,
I want to crush them.

00:17:46.273 --> 00:17:48.650
Don't talk like that about Mikey.

00:17:48.734 --> 00:17:50.778
Show him some respect!

00:17:51.361 --> 00:17:54.114
How the hell would you know
he's gotten weak?

00:17:54.198 --> 00:17:55.157
Tell me that!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:58.410
Even though you're a captain,
you're still no better than us!

00:17:58.494 --> 00:18:00.329
So don't get cocky.

00:18:00.412 --> 00:18:02.289
-Chifuyu!
-Now, now.

00:18:02.372 --> 00:18:05.000
Infighting is forbidden, you know?

00:18:05.084 --> 00:18:06.460
Hanma...

00:18:06.543 --> 00:18:10.089
Break that rule and I'll lose my temper.

00:18:10.172 --> 00:18:11.006
Understand?

00:18:11.507 --> 00:18:14.384
FIRST GENERATION TOKYO MANJI GANG

00:18:15.302 --> 00:18:17.846
What's the merit of working with you two?

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:21.391
I've got an informant
inside of BLACK DRAGON.

00:18:22.893 --> 00:18:25.187
I hate wasting time.

00:18:25.938 --> 00:18:26.772
Come with me.

00:18:27.606 --> 00:18:29.483
KARAOKE SYSTEM
KARAOKE PHANTOM

00:18:29.566 --> 00:18:30.943
10,000 YEN

00:18:31.026 --> 00:18:33.487
You'll make sure
they don't find out, right?

00:18:33.987 --> 00:18:36.365
If they do, I'm dead.

00:18:36.949 --> 00:18:38.826
<i>This is the informant.</i>

00:18:38.909 --> 00:18:40.327
Don't you worry.

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:43.288
Nobody here's ever going to rat on you.

00:18:43.872 --> 00:18:45.290
So, did you get the info?

00:18:45.374 --> 00:18:48.001
Yeah, about the boss's movements, right?

00:18:48.085 --> 00:18:49.628
Taiju's movements?

00:18:49.711 --> 00:18:50.546
Yeah.

00:18:50.629 --> 00:18:54.466
If we're going to crush BLACK DRAGON,
we got to know about Taiju.

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:56.552
What's he doing on a typical day?

00:18:56.635 --> 00:19:01.557
If we know what he's always doing,
we'll know what we're dealing with.

00:19:02.224 --> 00:19:04.560
Knowing your enemy
makes them easy to defeat.

00:19:04.643 --> 00:19:05.602
Oh, I get it.

00:19:06.687 --> 00:19:10.816
I'm the boss's gopher,
so I know most of what he does.

00:19:13.235 --> 00:19:14.695
First, the boss--

00:19:18.365 --> 00:19:20.117
What a disgusting room.

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.869
It smells of a rat.

00:19:22.452 --> 00:19:23.328
Koko...

00:19:25.038 --> 00:19:26.832
They've already found out.

00:19:26.915 --> 00:19:27.749
Yep.

00:19:28.375 --> 00:19:30.836
Things ended up badly
for the last rat we had.

00:19:31.545 --> 00:19:33.755
He couldn't handle it,
so he killed himself.

00:19:34.756 --> 00:19:36.800
You've got it all wrong, Koko!

00:19:36.884 --> 00:19:38.177
I didn't betray you guys!

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:41.847
-I'm just--
-I know you're not hard up for money.

00:19:42.973 --> 00:19:45.851
It's torture for you!

00:19:46.727 --> 00:19:48.020
Take this filth away.

00:19:48.103 --> 00:19:48.937
-Yes, Sir.
-Yes, Sir.

00:19:49.688 --> 00:19:52.566
Can't you overlook this?
I didn't do anything!

00:19:52.649 --> 00:19:55.027
-Please!
-The hell you didn't do anything!

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:56.570
-Don't!
-You're dead meat, scumbag!

00:19:57.863 --> 00:20:00.699
So... what do you want to do?

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:03.702
We don't intend to fight you.

00:20:03.785 --> 00:20:04.870
What?

00:20:06.705 --> 00:20:08.123
10,000 YEN

00:20:09.625 --> 00:20:10.792
100,000.

00:20:10.876 --> 00:20:11.752
What?

00:20:11.835 --> 00:20:15.756
I'll tell you what you want for 100,000.

00:20:22.012 --> 00:20:24.723
We want to know when Taiju will be alone.

00:20:26.642 --> 00:20:28.727
The boss is never alone.

00:20:29.228 --> 00:20:31.521
He's always got five men with him.

00:20:32.272 --> 00:20:33.690
Except on one day.

00:20:34.191 --> 00:20:35.317
And when's that?

00:20:35.817 --> 00:20:37.778
December 25th.

00:20:38.904 --> 00:20:39.738
Christmas.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:44.284
He may not look it,
but the boss is a devoted Christian.

00:20:45.202 --> 00:20:48.330
<i>Every year on Christmas night,
he goes to church to worship.</i>

00:20:49.331 --> 00:20:51.875
In the dead of night, and always alone.

00:20:52.376 --> 00:20:53.377
Got it.

00:20:54.044 --> 00:20:55.295
Anything else you want to know?

00:20:55.837 --> 00:20:57.172
That's plenty.

00:20:59.216 --> 00:21:01.426
Even alone, the boss is still tough.

00:21:02.344 --> 00:21:04.179
I doubt the four of you could defeat him.

00:21:05.597 --> 00:21:07.140
I can hardly wait for Christmas.

00:21:07.683 --> 00:21:09.685
Why are you betraying Taiju?

00:21:12.479 --> 00:21:14.773
I simply like the strong.

00:21:15.607 --> 00:21:19.069
If you want to know more,
get me another 100,000.

00:21:20.153 --> 00:21:23.282
I guess this means
that BLACK DRAGON isn't a monolith.

00:21:23.865 --> 00:21:24.700
Takemitchy.

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:30.998
I didn't find out when Taiju will be alone
just so we could attack him.

00:21:31.081 --> 00:21:31.915
What?

00:21:31.999 --> 00:21:34.418
Hakkai said he was going to kill Taiju.

00:21:34.918 --> 00:21:36.503
So, when would he kill him?

00:21:36.586 --> 00:21:37.754
Well...

00:21:38.797 --> 00:21:41.466
<i>Oh! When Taiju's alone!</i>

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:44.136
I get it! On Christmas night!

00:21:44.219 --> 00:21:46.596
Now you can stop Hakkai.

00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:50.100
Kisaki, that's why you're doing this?

00:21:51.435 --> 00:21:54.229
What's wrong with doing something
to help my teammates?

00:21:57.566 --> 00:22:01.611
The four of us here
will stop Hakkai and destroy Taiju.

00:22:02.988 --> 00:22:05.532
This'll be our secret battle
on Christmas night.

00:22:06.533 --> 00:22:09.619
<i>What the hell is this guy scheming?</i>

00:23:38.333 --> 00:23:40.335
Translation by Brian Athey
